                pp. 44-53, World Scientific (2000) (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/9789812793850_0006"}> doi:10.1142/9789812793850_0006
                )
          %h3#general General
          %ul
            %li#CastellaniDAuriaFre
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
          %p The seminal classification result of simple supersymmetry algebras is due to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Werner+Nahm"}> Werner Nahm
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Supersymmetries and their Representations
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/120988?ln=en"} spire
          %p Lecture notes include
          %ul
            %li
